{"quest_id": 4512, "name": "宝剣を抱く者", "description": "辺境の砂漠で魔物に\n襲われている女性を助け出せ！\n＜出撃時の初期ＨＰ減少：小＞\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "modifier_notes": ["出撃時の初期ＨＰ減少：小"], "event": "莫邪の宝剣", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920062, "map_no": 3664, "level": 80, "multiplier": 0.8, "charisma": 25, "exp": 120, "gold": 700, "drops": [{"card": 6, "c": 1}, {"card": 64, "c": 1}, {"card": 55, "c": 1}, {"item": 1005, "c": 1}, {"item": 5002, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 9, "params": [20], "expression": "!IsPlayerSupportUnit();"}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 17, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 960, "attack": 240, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 49, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098416, "race_id": 2, "master_id": 85, "global_id": 84, "spawn_sec": 3}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1440, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 1800, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 180, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098368, "race_id": 2, "master_id": 88, "global_id": 87, "spawn_sec": 31}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 800, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_range": 170, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 25, "attack_interval": 131, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098432, "race_id": 2, "missile_id": 15, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 87, "global_id": 86, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 98}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "エレイン", "text": "きゃっ……もう何なのよ、この砂ぼこりは。\nふつうに進軍するだけで疲れちゃうわ。\n日差しも強いし。はぁ、倒れちゃいそう……。", "face": "u36"}, {"name": "ハシム", "text": "騎乗の身のくせに何をへばることがあるのだ？\nまあ砂漠での行軍を俺と比べるのは酷か……。\n経験が違うのだよ、経験がね。がっはっは！", "face": "u170"}, {"name": "アサル", "text": "私達は砂漠の戦士。威張る事ではありません。\nここら一帯の魔物の討伐にしたって、本来で\nあれば私達で解決すべき事案なのですから。", "face": "u172"}, {"name": "砂漠兵士", "text": "おい、見ろよ！\nあそこに誰か倒れてるぞ！？\n……ん、おいおい、女じゃねえか！？", "face": "u169"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "うぅ……はやく、ここから……。\n逃げなく、ては……。", "face": "u341"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "しっかりしてください！\n一体なにがあったと言うのですか？", "face": "l077ae4c90c18"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "前方に敵影を確認！\nどうやら、こちらに向かってきているようです！", "face": "l199377a44b3f"}, {"name": "エレイン", "text": "タイミング悪ぅ……。\nまあいいわ、憂さ晴らしに一暴れしてやるわよ！", "face": "u36"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、急ぎ戦いのご準備を。\nこの暑さで兵の体力が消耗しています。\nお気を付けください。", "face": "l077ae4c90c18"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "何とか敵を退けたようですね。\nさあ、一刻も早く、彼女をこちらに運びましょう。", "face": "l077ae4c90c18"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "…………見つけたぞ、皇女スクハ。", "face": "l5df4e3986dac"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "スクハを匿ったやつらが何者かは知らんが、\nそう遠くへは行けまい。", "face": "l5df4e3986dac"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "それに、こちらには『干将剣』があるのだ。\n逃げることなどできんぞ、皇女スクハ……。", "face": "l5df4e3986dac"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "妖虎仙さまの為にも、必ずや貴様を……。", "face": "l5df4e3986dac"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920062_3664", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 674, "y": 22}, {"k": "m", "x": 612, "y": 154, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 490, "y": 159, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 384, "y": 192, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 308, "y": 267, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 208, "y": 313, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 335, "y": 362, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 438, "y": 414, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 560, "y": 438, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 689, "y": 400, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 771, "y": 309, "id": 209}, {"k": "r", "x": 568, "y": 242, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 428, "y": 249, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 458, "y": 340, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 602, "y": 358, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 281, "y": 170, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 386, "y": 94, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 232, "y": 413, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 345, "y": 462, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 504, "y": 517, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 528, "y": 81, "id": 309}, {"k": "r", "x": 661, "y": 514, "id": 310}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true}